  "body": "Currently in the platform, the only interface with [unenumerable](http://heycam.github.io/webidl/#dfn-unenumerable) property names is [NamedNodeMap](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-htmlcollection-item). In that interface, they are _all_ unenumerable.\n\nWebIDL should reflect that and forbid mixing unenumerable and enumerable property names.\n",
